{"id":"raznitsa","lemma":"разница","pos":"noun","rank":621,"glosses":["difference (quality of being different, can be used to refer to the difference itself without talking about its size)"],"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/c/c3/Ru-%D1%80%D0%B0%D0%B7%D0%BD%D0%B8%D1%86%D0%B0.ogg/Ru-%D1%80%D0%B0%D0%B7%D0%BD%D0%B8%D1%86%D0%B0.ogg.mp3","gender":"f","forms":{"genitive":"разницы","plural":"разницы"},"examples":[{"text":"Тебе-то какая разница?","en":"What difference does that make to you?","words":[{"g":"(to) you","l":"ты"},{"g":"that"},null,null]},{"text":"Большой разницы нет.","en":"There's not a big difference.","words":[{"g":"big, large, great"},null,{"g":"no / there isn't"}]},{"text":"В чём была разница?","en":"What was the difference?","words":[{"g":"in"},{"g":"what","l":"что"},{"g":"was","l":"быть"},null]},{"text":"Ты всё ещё не видишь разницы?","en":"Do you still not see the difference?","words":[{"g":"you"},null,null,{"g":"not"},{"g":"to see","l":"видеть"},null],"phrases":[[1,3,"still, yet, as yet"]]},{"text":"Скажи мне, пожалуйста, в чём разница.","en":"Please tell me what the difference is.","words":[{"g":"to say, to tell","l":"сказать"},{"g":"(to) me","l":"я"},{"g":"please"},{"g":"in"},{"g":"what","l":"что"},null]}]}